    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailer coming soon!</strong> - <i>Summer 2025</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickstarter Campaign</strong> - <i>Fall 2025</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dating &amp; Dragons \u2013 A Love Quest</strong></i> is a narrative RPG dating sim packed with every fantasy trope you love. Sneak out with the thief, wreak havoc with the warrior, or flirt with the bard. Explore branching adventures with multiple endings and hidden secrets. Roll those dice and watch out for dragons!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/9f55865830e6d923dc6282c2b7bc892f.avif?t=1750616462\" width=526 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of four playable characters.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an adventure from the quest board.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your party with one or more of the six love interests.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the dungeon: monsters, traps, and the occasional steamy scene at camp await.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will determine the outcome of the mission... and whether your date falls in love with you!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonus collectables and start a new adventure: there are many to explore!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/0564a635aa3393188b03af4e5d375970.avif?t=1750616462\" width=616 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance, action and comedy</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced adventures full of witty dialogue, cheesy romance with 6 love interests, and dozens of relatable moments every RPG fan will appreciate.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/073461161879096a5b223b29d034a5d5.poster.avif?t=1750616462\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/073461161879096a5b223b29d034a5d5.webm?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/073461161879096a5b223b29d034a5d5.mp4?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching choices, multiple endings</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All is fair in love and war. Choose how to overcome the challenges or flirt with your date. Your decisions determine which ending you get, so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/6f85ced492dd337b431fd876daeec12c.poster.avif?t=1750616462\" width=614 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/6f85ced492dd337b431fd876daeec12c.webm?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/6f85ced492dd337b431fd876daeec12c.mp4?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills, items, feats</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, loot, or steal useful items and feats to boost your skills and score that natural 20. With dozens to discover, every run feels unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/e0e7c194bcda692fb7da7ccd98b096b7.poster.avif?t=1750616462\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/e0e7c194bcda692fb7da7ccd98b096b7.webm?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/e0e7c194bcda692fb7da7ccd98b096b7.mp4?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four playable characters</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that fits your playstyle, or just the one that\u00a0looks hottest to you! Unlock unique ending illustrations and discover hidden interactions with the love interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/8d7c8cef9da7b051037c8a6384048323.poster.avif?t=1750616462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/8d7c8cef9da7b051037c8a6384048323.webm?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049840/extras/8d7c8cef9da7b051037c8a6384048323.mp4?t=1750616462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick an adventure, face the dungeon, and secure your happily ever after. Didn't succeed? No worries! Each run takes under an hour, and your new unlocked goodies and knowledge might help you in the next love quest!\u00a0</p>",
